PARITY MAP (web symbol → native)
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  VehicleSelection {all_sticky|specific}        → VehicleMultiSelectValue {.allSticky|.specific([Int])}
  vehicleLabel(v)                               → VehicleMultiSelectProjector.vehicleLabel(...)  (— model / (VIN ...last4))
  lastFourVin / dedupSort                       → lastFourVIN / dedupSort  (id>0, de-dupe, sort)
  triggerSummary (5 branches)                   → VehicleMultiSelectSummary {.all/.none/.one/.partial/.count}
  handleToggleAll (D13 restore)                 → toggleAll(value, previousSpecific)
  handleToggleVehicle                           → toggleVehicle(value, id)
  unknownIds (D10, Unknown badge)               → unknownIDs(value, knownIDs) → unknownRows
  isFleetEmpty → disabled trigger + help        → phase .empty → disabled trigger + emptyFleetHelp
  errorKey → danger border + <p role=alert>     → errorText + danger trigger border + ErrorText view
  hydrateVehicleSelection / buildVehiclePayload → Projector.hydrate / buildPayload (D11/D12/D14)
  t(key, default) [9 keys]                      → VehicleMultiSelectStrings (P1/S10) — verbatim fallbacks
  useId (trigger/popover/error ids)             → SwiftUI .popover binding + accessibility identity
  (no web peer) view.opened                     → P1/S11 telemetry, slug "VehicleMultiSelect", once per instance

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
STATES (every one renders — verified by previews + tests)
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  loading  → skeleton trigger pill (native leaf).
  content  → trigger (summary Badge + chevron) + .popover (All sentinel / vehicle rows / unknown rows).
  empty    → web disables the trigger for an empty fleet → native .empty phase: disabled trigger + help line.
  error    → fetch-failure retry tile (native leaf; web has no QueryError peer).
  stale    → freshness chip + auto-refresh ONCE (resets after a live read).
  offline  → freshness chip; cached fleet kept; no refetch.
  validation error (web errorKey) → danger trigger border + inline error text (orthogonal to phase).

